Allow-only mode (a kids' device): only names on the allow lists resolve.
Response-side checks still apply the deny lists but not allow-only.

-- list kids allow domains --
school.example
||edu.example^
-- list ads block adblock --
||ads.example^
-- options --
allowOnly
-- expect --
school.example         allow kids school.example
www.school.example     block - -
x.edu.example          allow kids ||edu.example^
edu.example            allow kids ||edu.example^
ads.example            block - -
random.example         block - -
cname:ads.example      block ads ||ads.example^
cname:x.edu.example    pass
cname:random.example   pass
